ADDING A NEW TILE:

    1. go into systems/assets/assets.py
    2. add file path to sprites:
        e.g.    "Wall": Sprite("images/tiles/Wall.png", "Wall"),
                "Floor": Sprite("images/tiles/Floor.png", "Floor"),

    3. go into systems/world/level_parser.py
    4. add tile to IMAGE_MAP like the rest